{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.7, "text": "In this town, there's a monster that can only move in the dark."}, {"start": 4.18, "end": 7.94, "text": "And last night, it grabbed a guard before we managed to freeze it with our lights."}, {"start": 8.46, "end": 12.36, "text": "Now the monster was still holding him, and nobody knew how to save him."}, {"start": 12.78, "end": 16.54, "text": "My dad, the head of security, had every spotlight pointed at it."}, {"start": 16.74, "end": 18.6, "text": "So, we called the fire department."}, {"start": 19.2, "end": 23.68, "text": "Two firefighters climbed up a giant ladder and carefully pulled the guard free."}, {"start": 24.14, "end": 26.16, "text": "The monster didn't move an inch."}, {"start": 26.16, "end": 29.98, "text": "Everyone started cheering, but my dad wasn't celebrating."}, {"start": 30.6, "end": 32.2, "text": "We couldn't keep those lights on forever."}, {"start": 32.92, "end": 34.66, "text": "That's when he came up with a plan."}, {"start": 35.4, "end": 39.54, "text": "Outside our town was an old industrial hanger with huge steel doors."}, {"start": 40.0, "end": 42.74, "text": "My dad wanted to fill it with thousands of fireflies."}, {"start": 43.18, "end": 45.88, "text": "Their glowing bodies would light up the entire building."}, {"start": 46.34, "end": 50.06, "text": "And unlike outside in the city, the fireflies couldn't fly away."}, {"start": 50.5, "end": 54.06, "text": "So even if the power went out, the monster would stay frozen."}, {"start": 54.06, "end": 59.2, "text": "We spent the entire day collecting fireflies and released them inside the hanger."}, {"start": 59.88, "end": 62.1, "text": "Soon, the entire building was glowing."}, {"start": 62.82, "end": 65.26, "text": "Now, we just had to get the monster inside."}, {"start": 65.88, "end": 68.32, "text": "First, we cleared every street along the route."}, {"start": 68.66, "end": 71.24, "text": "Then, we placed giant spotlights everywhere."}, {"start": 71.72, "end": 72.52, "text": "My dad shouted,"}, {"start": 72.94, "end": 73.44, "text": "Lights off!"}, {"start": 73.88, "end": 76.38, "text": "For three seconds, the monster could move."}, {"start": 76.82, "end": 79.04, "text": "It took several giant steps forward."}, {"start": 79.56, "end": 80.1, "text": "Lights on!"}, {"start": 80.54, "end": 81.14, "text": "It froze."}, {"start": 81.14, "end": 84.04, "text": "We repeated this again and again."}, {"start": 84.52, "end": 87.08, "text": "Each time, the monster got closer to the hanger,"}, {"start": 87.34, "end": 89.46, "text": "until finally, it reached the entrance."}, {"start": 89.94, "end": 92.06, "text": "But suddenly, it turned toward us."}, {"start": 92.56, "end": 93.4, "text": "My dad screamed,"}, {"start": 93.84, "end": 94.36, "text": "Lights on!"}, {"start": 94.6, "end": 94.94, "text": "Now!"}, {"start": 95.44, "end": 97.56, "text": "The monster stopped just a few feet away."}, {"start": 97.96, "end": 99.14, "text": "My heart was racing."}, {"start": 99.58, "end": 101.26, "text": "We had one last chance."}, {"start": 101.68, "end": 104.58, "text": "I ran behind the hanger and opened the giant back doors."}, {"start": 105.1, "end": 107.66, "text": "Then, my dad switched off the outside spotlights."}, {"start": 107.66, "end": 111.58, "text": "The monster saw a way through the building and walked straight inside."}, {"start": 112.2, "end": 112.4, "text": "Now!"}, {"start": 112.8, "end": 114.34, "text": "I slammed the emergency switch."}, {"start": 114.78, "end": 117.0, "text": "The massive steel doors slammed shut."}, {"start": 117.76, "end": 120.68, "text": "Thousands of fireflies surrounded the monster and it froze."}, {"start": 121.22, "end": 122.44, "text": "We had done it!"}, {"start": 122.72, "end": 125.74, "text": "The next morning, the rescued guard was back with his family"}, {"start": 125.74, "end": 128.1, "text": "and our town was finally safe."}, {"start": 128.58, "end": 130.7, "text": "The monster was trapped inside the hanger,"}, {"start": 131.02, "end": 133.62, "text": "surrounded by thousands of glowing fireflies."}, {"start": 134.06, "end": 135.76, "text": "And for the first time in years,"}, {"start": 135.76, "end": 138.82, "text": "we could finally sleep without being afraid."}], "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.2}, {"w": "this", "s": 0.2, "e": 0.38}, {"w": "town,", "s": 0.38, "e": 0.72}, {"w": "there's", "s": 1.06, "e": 1.22}, {"w": "a", "s": 1.22, "e": 1.38}, {"w": "monster", "s": 1.38, "e": 1.74}, {"w": "that", "s": 1.74, "e": 1.98}, {"w": "can", "s": 1.98, "e": 2.12}, {"w": "only", "s": 2.12, "e": 2.52}, {"w": "move", "s": 2.52, "e": 2.88}, {"w": "in", "s": 2.88, "e": 3.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 3.18, "e": 3.34}, {"w": "dark.", "s": 3.34, "e": 3.7}, {"w": "And", "s": 4.18, "e": 4.28}, {"w": "last", "s": 4.28, "e": 4.48}, {"w": "night,", "s": 4.48, "e": 4.78}, {"w": "it", "s": 5.04, "e": 5.16}, {"w": "grabbed", "s": 5.16, "e": 5.46}, {"w": "a", "s": 5.46, "e": 5.78}, {"w": "guard", "s": 5.78, "e": 5.94}, {"w": "before", "s": 5.94, "e": 6.28}, {"w": "we", "s": 6.28, "e": 6.46}, {"w": "managed", "s": 6.46, "e": 6.7}, {"w": "to", "s": 6.7, "e": 6.92}, {"w": "freeze", "s": 6.92, "e": 7.2}, {"w": "it", "s": 7.2, "e": 7.38}, {"w": "with", "s": 7.38, "e": 7.52}, {"w": "our", "s": 7.52, "e": 7.66}, {"w": "lights.", "s": 7.66, "e": 7.94}, {"w": "Now", "s": 8.46, "e": 8.7}, {"w": "the", "s": 8.7, "e": 8.92}, {"w": "monster", "s": 8.92, "e": 9.24}, {"w": "was", "s": 9.24, "e": 9.48}, {"w": "still", "s": 9.48, "e": 9.86}, {"w": "holding", "s": 9.86, "e": 10.26}, {"w": "him,", "s": 10.26, "e": 10.54}, {"w": "and", "s": 10.74, "e": 10.94}, {"w": "nobody", "s": 10.94, "e": 11.24}, {"w": "knew", "s": 11.24, "e": 11.56}, {"w": "how", "s": 11.56, "e": 11.72}, {"w": "to", "s": 11.72, "e": 11.84}, {"w": "save", "s": 11.84, "e": 12.1}, {"w": "him.", "s": 12.1, "e": 12.36}, {"w": "My", "s": 12.78, "e": 12.96}, {"w": "dad,", "s": 12.96, "e": 13.22}, {"w": "the", "s": 